# Manually run individual requests; this file is not a bulk crawler.
# Replace the descriptive User-Agent with your own project/contact information.
@userAgent = my-aoe-tool/0.1 (replace-with-project-or-contact-url)
@profileId = 4635035
@matchId = 250457718
@world = https://aoe4world.com/api/v0
@backend = https://aoe-api.worldsedgelink.com
@official = https://api.ageofempires.com
@guides = https://aoe4-guides-api-7h2vti5ckq-ey.a.run.app

### AoE4 World profile
GET {{world}}/players/{{profileId}}
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Latest game (provider-recommended polling route)
GET {{world}}/players/{{profileId}}/games/last
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Small player-history request (documented; not part of the live probes)
GET {{world}}/players/{{profileId}}/games?limit=1&leaderboard=rm_team
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Discover raw backend identifiers
GET {{backend}}/community/leaderboard/getAvailableLeaderboards?title=age4
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Profile stats, JSON array encoded inside the query
GET {{backend}}/community/leaderboard/getPersonalStat?title=age4&profile_ids=%5B{{profileId}}%5D
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### One raw match; response uses matchHistory
GET {{backend}}/community/leaderboard/getMatchHistory?title=age4&matchIDs=%5B{{matchId}}%5D
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Replay metadata; URLs in the response expire and should not be logged
GET {{backend}}/community/leaderboard/getReplayFiles?title=age4&matchIDs=%5B{{matchId}}%5D
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Official leaderboard read-only POST; sorting is explicit
POST {{official}}/api/ageiv/Leaderboard
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

{"region":7,"versus":"players","matchType":"unranked","teamSize":"1v1","searchPlayer":"","page":1,"count":1,"sortColumn":"rank","sortDirection":"ASC","isConsole":false}

### Discover seasonal leaderboard IDs before using EventLeaderboard
GET {{official}}/api/ageiv/EventList?isConsole=false
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Official match detail read-only POST
POST {{official}}/api/GameStats/AgeIV/GetMatchDetail
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

{"profileId":{{profileId}},"game":"age4","matchId":{{matchId}}}

### Static civilization mapping
GET https://data.aoe4world.com/civilizations/civs-index.json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### One static game object
GET https://data.aoe4world.com/units/english/horseman-2.json
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Build lists must use the full API host
GET {{guides}}/builds?civ=ENG
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Website proxy supports individual builds and overlay conversion
GET https://aoe4guides.com/api/builds/07qM0jShA7USYa8hprgp?overlay=true
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### Steam-only concurrent player count
GET https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=1466860
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### AoE2 Companion ladder discovery
GET https://data.aoe2companion.com/api/leaderboards
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}

### aoestats weekly export index (does not download bulk files)
GET https://aoestats.io/api/db_dumps
User-Agent: {{userAgent}}
